From 8c01e904ec67969f210cca50ca1a23c104b2ca55 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Paul Scheduikat <luantak@pm.me>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 08:57:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] runtime obfuscation

Translate garbled runtime package paths and symbols throughout the compiler, assembler, linker, ABI metadata, and runtime special cases so runtime and its dependencies can follow the normal obfuscation path without weakening toolchain checks.
